//     constant — proving the typed API → wire layer wires the right name.
//
// This catches: codegen bugs in build() field emission, request_traits
// table drift, opcode regressions in StreamingJsonbBuilder, and any
// rename / dispatch-prefix errors. The pre-COBS opcode layer is what
// these tests exercise; the COBS framing + `{:...:}` envelope are
